1
00:00:08,555 --> 00:00:13,431
Everybody you work for, in one book
rather than in six people's phones.

2
00:00:13,883 --> 00:00:21,917
A new one is a name and a way of
reaching them. Everything else can wait.

3
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:27,246
How you reach them, and in which
language they would rather be written to.

4
00:00:27,699 --> 00:00:34,265
And which part of the business they
belong to. It is asked because a client filed

5
00:00:34,265 --> 00:00:36,941
nowhere is a client nobody finds.

6
00:00:37,394 --> 00:00:41,945
Saved, and from now on they can be
chosen wherever a client is needed.

7
00:00:42,397 --> 00:00:48,129
Their record holds the jobs, the
invoices and the conversation, without anybody

8
00:00:48,129 --> 00:00:49,363
keeping a folder.

9
00:00:49,814 --> 00:00:53,808
Next: the difference between a
